Limit: BEGIN EXCLUSIVE climbs SHARED, RESERVED, PENDING, EXCLUSIVE, so every contender holds SHARED for a moment and EXCLUSIVE is granted only once no SHARED lock stands; with no busy wait two starts at once could each refuse the other and neither held
